# Live2D runtimes are never committed. They are staged locally (see ADR-0035).
# Local sources default to `.local/live2d/live2d.min.js` and
# `.local/live2d/live2dcubismcore.min.js`, or LIVE2D_CUBISM2_CORE /
# LIVE2D_CUBISM_CORE. CUBISM_WEB_SDK_DIR remains a Core-only fallback.
